-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Run by script through the real loader on a NextZXOS 26.11 card
              copy in default, Enhanced and with all cheats; 1.0 not yet
              played by the owner; published at his request

  Replay      5 scripted recordings (title, menus, define keys, play, 21 holds
              by a test call, game over, a new game, the hidden game), 32815
              frames: 269627 hooks in Enhanced run original and build from one
              state each, every register with R and all 48K RAM; Layer 2
              against an independent picture from the set's planes on 3655
              pictures; 21 broken builds all caught. The default look has no
              hook; nextboot.rom_paths over 26.11's ROM3.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: through the real .NEXCLASH loader on a
              private NextZXOS 26.11 card copy in default, Enhanced, all
              cheats and the hidden game; output byte for byte nxc.py; 15
              emulated minutes of soak and a flicker pass on each build;
              pictures viewed. Hardware: none.

  Coverage    Scripted input, no human play: the first hold played, the other
              20 reached by a test call, menus, define keys, game over, a new
              game, the hidden game; not reached: pause, completing a hold by
              play, finishing the game.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
